ue=\"glass-house\">The Glass House of LOL</option>\n<option value=\"juliet-balcony\">Juliet's Balcony (Candlelight)</option>\n<option value=\"cafe-de-landour\">Cafe De Landour &amp; Bakery</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 sm:col-span-2\">\n<label class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface\">Number of Guests</label>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n<label class=\"flex-1 text-center py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container cursor-pointer font-title-md text-title-md hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\">\n<input aria-label=\"radio\" id=\"dining-field-5\" checked class=\"sr-only\" name=\"guests\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"> 2 Guests\n                </label>\n<label class=\"flex-1 text-center py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container cursor-pointer font-title-md text-title-md hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\">\n<input aria-label=\"radio\" id=\"dining-field-6\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"guests\" type=\"radio\" value=\"4\"> 3-4 Guests\n                </label>\n<label class=\"flex-1 text-center py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container cursor-pointer font-title-md text-title-md hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\">\n<input aria-label=\"radio\" id=\"dining-field-7\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"guests\" type=\"radio\" value=\"6+\"> 5+ Group\n                </label>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 sm:col-span-2\">\n<label for=\"dining-field-8\" class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface\">Special Requests &amp; Occasion</label>\n<textarea aria-label=\"Special Requests & Occasion\" name=\"dining-field-8\" id=\"dining-field-8\" class=\"w-full p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest\" placeholder=\"Anniversary celebration, vegan requirements, specific vantage table request...\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sm:col-span-2 pt-2\">\n<button aria-label=\"Reserve Sanctuary Table\" class=\"w-full py-4 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-pine-muted transition-colors\" type=\"submit\">\n                Reserve Sanctuary Table\n              </button>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline text-center mt-2.5\">No immediate deposit required. We will confirm your table allocation within two hours.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"demo-note\">Demo inquiry only. No message or reservation will be sent.</p></form>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- SURROUNDINGS & HERITAGE RIDGE PROXIMITY -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-surface-container-low py-20\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col gap-10\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-2\">Historic Cantonment Walk</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-display text-headline-lg text-primary\">Within Steps of Our Dining Ridge</h2>\n</div>\n<a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-primary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-cedar-gold transition-colors\" data-path=\"location\" href=\"/contact\">\n<span>View Landour Walking Route</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">map</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n<div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[22px]\">storefront</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase\">200 Metres</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-display text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1\">Historic Char Dukan</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">The iconic four vintage shops serving mountain tea and bun maska since the British cantonment era.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[22px]\">church</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase\">350 Metres</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-display text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1\">St. Paul's Church</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Built in 1839 amidst towering deodars; a silent sanctuary of colonial history and quiet strolls.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[22px]\">hiking</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase\">800 Metres</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-display text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1\">Lal Tibba Viewpoint</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">The highest peak of Mussoorie offering Japanese monocular views of Kedarnath, Badrinath, and snowline peaks.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[22px]\">shopping_bag</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase\">1.2 KM Walk</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-display text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1\">Sister's Bazaar</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Famous for Prakash Stores handmade peanut butter, cheese, and vintage hill-station confectionery.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</main>",
